{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1753","id":4152592662,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p873g4kW","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1753","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1753.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1753.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1753","number":1753,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Seed Paper 1 Integration semantic authority","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1744\n\n## What changed\n\nSeeds the cumulative Paper 1 semantic authority with the complete discoverable Integration shard while preserving the exact Paper 3 predecessor release.\n\n- freezes the exact P1 structural scope at 772 Questions and 2,194 QuestionParts (1,634 score-owning and 560 instruction-only)\n- authenticates the active P3 manifest, semantic registry, ProcedureModel library, and graph bytes before building the P1 overlay\n- conserves all 128 inherited P1 records and their 64 approved / 53 candidate / 11 abstain states with no identity recreation or automatic promotion\n- reviews 111 verified Integration Questions and all 224 score-owning parts; 102 are inherited and nine are newly reviewed watermark-normalized Questions\n- distinguishes direct antiderivative (45 approved parts), bounded-area (2), and volume-of-revolution (5) procedures; the latter two add reusable canonical models because their boundary/axis/radius setup is not represented by the predecessor direct model\n- audits all 52 approved parts for composite same-part methods and emits the exact-evidence Differentiation secondary/support semantics for qrow_9709_w19_qp_12_q10::q10/i as candidate-only foreign ownership\n- publishes a compact P1 Integration delta, full P1 terminal-disposition inventory, reconciliation ledger, active P1 manifest, deterministic cumulative overlay, and authenticated readback receipt\n- captures 46 exact-evidence foreign-family supporting candidates with approved-read isolation\n- derives release custody from actual overlay classification/instance provenance, so candidate-only P1 previews return the P1 schema and manifest rather than a contradictory P3 receipt\n- makes the Integration readback receipt select and validate authority from the actual response surface, with a regression that fails on stale P3 authority attached to a P1 response\n\n## Metrics\n\n- reviewed_question_count: 111\n- newly_reviewed_question_count: 9\n- explicitly_unenriched_question_count: 661\n- alternative_branch_count: 0\n- procedure_reuse_ratio: 52 approved bindings / 3 used ProcedureModels = 17.333333\n\n## Safety and integrity\n\n- structural authority writes: 0\n- inherited state promotions: 0\n- duplicate inherited identities: 0\n- P3 predecessor semantic regressions: 0\n- candidate exposed as approved: 0\n- structural nodes copied into P1 overlay: 0\n- provider and remote writes: 0\n- approved Integration API readback: 52/52 (100%)\n\n## Verification at fcc6490cb26cea5c407bdecdeed5a21bc477ace5\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1744_p1_integration_semantic_kg.test.py` — 10 passed\n- `node --test scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1719_integration_techniques_readback.test.mjs` — 2 passed\n- `node scripts/vlm/issue_1719_integration_techniques_readback.mjs --check` — PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1731_paper3_final_reconciliation.test.py` — 8 passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1744_p1_integration_semantic_kg.py --check` — deterministic PASS\n- pinned Jest runtime/gateway suites — 72 passed\n- ESLint on all modified JavaScript files — PASS\n- Python and Node syntax checks — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n","created_at":"2026-07-28T15:03:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T15:40:36Z","closed_at":"2026-07-28T15:40:36Z","merged_at":"2026-07-28T15:40:36Z","merge_commit_sha":"e13988ee58987d15249f45af0bd548bff5cf87b7","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1753/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1753/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1753/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/fcc6490cb26cea5c407bdecdeed5a21bc477ace5","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1744-p1-integration-semantic-production","ref":"task/1744-p1-integration-semantic-production","sha":"fcc6490cb26cea5c407bdecdeed5a21bc477ace5","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sam